!.env.example
# Runtime database: local auth state (users, password hashes, lockout
# counters). Must never be committed — each environment owns its own.
# The `*` also covers migration backups (users.json.migrated, etc.).
data/users.json*
# SQLite store + dev mail outbox (runtime artifacts, per-environment).
data/*.db
data/*.db-*
data/outbox/
